msgstr "English"

msgid "人格設定 (System Prompt)："
msgstr "Personality (System Prompt):"

msgid "AI 回應機率 (%)："
msgstr "AI Response Probability (%):"

msgid "設定使用 AI 的機率（1-100%）。建議 10% 以控制成本。"
msgstr "Set the probability of using AI (1-100%). Recommended: 10% to control costs."

msgid "觸發頁面："
msgstr "Trigger Pages:"

msgid "WordPress 條件標籤，逗號分隔（如：is_single,is_page）"
msgstr "WordPress conditional tags, comma-separated (e.g., is_single,is_page)"

msgid "AI 對話文字顏色："
msgstr "AI Dialog Text Color:"

msgid "設定 AI 對話載入訊息（…ふむ。この記事か。どれ…）的文字顏色"
msgstr "Set the text color for AI loading message"

msgid "AI 對話顯示時間（秒）："
msgstr "AI Dialog Display Time (seconds):"

msgid "設定 AI 對話顯示的時間長度。在此期間，自動對話會暫停，避免 AI 對話被覆蓋（建議 5-10 秒）"
msgstr "Set how long AI dialog displays. Auto talk pauses during this time to prevent AI dialog from being overwritten (recommended: 5-10 seconds)"

msgid "啟用首次訪客打招呼"
msgstr "Enable first-time visitor greeting"

msgid "當訪客第一次訪問網站時，根據訪客來源（使用 Slimstat API）用 AI 生成個性化打招呼訊息。每個訪客只會看到一次。"
msgstr "When a visitor comes for the first time, generate a personalized greeting using AI based on visitor origin (via Slimstat API). Each visitor sees this only once."

msgid "首次訪客打招呼提示詞："
msgstr "First-time Visitor Greeting Prompt:"

