msgstr "Code Extensions"

msgid "您可以在春菜的資訊框中使用特殊代碼來顯示特定的資訊，例如日誌列表。"
msgstr "You can use special codes in the character's message box to display specific information, such as post lists."

msgid "更多擴展代碼資訊請參閱："
msgstr "For more extension codes, visit:"

