# Message Page
# ========================================

msgid "固定資訊："
msgstr "Fixed Message:"

msgid "此資訊將顯示在每條會話的後面，不可使用 HTML 代碼。"
msgstr "This message appears after every dialog. HTML is not allowed."

msgid "通用會話："
msgstr "Common Messages:"

msgid "所有春菜共用的會話內容。"
msgstr "Messages shared by all characters."

msgid "一旦填寫此欄，通用會話將取代每個春菜的自訂會話。清空此欄則使用各春菜的預設自訂會話。"
msgstr "If filled, these messages replace each character's custom messages. Leave empty to use each character's own messages."

